      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUT TO STAY (1) has had four runs this prep and is yet to finish in the top three but he might just have found his spot here running from the pegs. Sound last time over 1660m at Hamilton, finishing 4.5 metres away from the winner in fourth. Meets a similar line up and he can take this out. BINALONG MATE (5) scored by 1.75 metres at Melton over 2240m last start at his first run back from a spell. Won't find this any harder and he can go right on with the job. Think that pair hold the aces. MIKIS PLEASURE (2) is in the mix following a sixth at her most recent appearance over 2240m at Melton. TOPSIES BLING (7) is worth some thought after her last-start sixth when resuming over 1660m at Hamilton on August 10.",
